(Yeah, thanks a lot, C.J. As you know, A100 is a very different type of GPU. This is our first ) Tj
T*
(universal computing GPU. It's great at high performance computing, it's great at data ) Tj
T*
(analytics, it's great at training and also for our highest-end GPUs, it is also the first time) Tj
T*
( that it is incredible for inference. It's some 20 times faster than previous generation. It ) Tj
T*
(introduces some really exciting new computational formats like TF32, TensorFloat 32 for ) Tj
T*
(training and with multi-instance GPU, turning our GPU -- one GPU into a whole bunch of smaller) Tj
T*
( GPUs, autonomous GPUs to improve performance and reducing latency.) Tj
T*
